{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24920","headline":"曲江亭望慈恩寺杏园花发 · 李君何","name":"曲江亭望慈恩寺杏园花发","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春晴凭水轩，仙杏发南园。\n开蘂风初晓，浮香景欲暄。\n光华临御陌，色相对空门。\n野雪遥添净，山烟近借繁。\n地闲分鹿苑，景胜类桃源。\n况值新晴日，芳枝度彩鸳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李君何","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24920.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24920","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}